# Web quality

For Web / Next.js UI work:

CODE → BUILD → BROWSER → ACCESSIBILITY → CONSOLE → NETWORK → PERFORMANCE → E2E → REGRESSION → PRODUCTION SMOKE

Applicable tools: Playwright (CLI + MCP when exploratory), Chrome DevTools / cursor-ide-browser, Lighthouse / `pnpm lighthouse:mobile`, axe-core where wired, visual regression specs.

Never declare Web UI complete from unit tests alone.

Do not lower the Lighthouse mobile gate in CI. Honor `prefers-reduced-motion`. Keep landing-motion coverage meaningful.
